        "created_at": "2023-11-16T19:51:50.441Z",
        "cooked": "<p>The new expansion will have 5 hero decks that were in EE, as well as one completely new to DE.</p>\n<p>There will be more expansions down the line.</p>\n<p>I believe they are supposed to be shipped by July next year.</p><aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\" data-onebox-src=\"https://www.backerkit.com/c/projects/greater-than-games/sentinels-of-the-multiverse-disparation-expansion#top\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n      <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/7/7fe466bbcb3ec594cdeed7c95a93fea01697b0c0.png\" class=\"site-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\">\n\n      <a href=\"https://www.backerkit.com/c/projects/greater-than-games/sentinels-of-the-multiverse-disparation-expansion#top\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">BackerKit</a>\n  </header>\n\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    <div class=\"aspect-image\" style=\"--aspect-ratio:690/388;\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/a/aa307992c3513b16947ac8e33efcc123cf900863_2_690x388.jpeg\" class=\"thumbnail\" width=\"690\" height=\"388\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/a/aa307992c3513b16947ac8e33efcc123cf900863_2_690x388.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/a/aa307992c3513b16947ac8e33efcc123cf900863.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/a/aa307992c3513b16947ac8e33efcc123cf900863.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/a/aa307992c3513b16947ac8e33efcc123cf900863_2_10x10.png\"></div>\n\n<h3><a href=\"https://www.backerkit.com/c/projects/greater-than-games/sentinels-of-the-multiverse-disparation-expansion#top\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Sentinels of the Multiverse: Disparation Expansion</a></h3>\n\n  <p>This new expansion to the hit cooperative comic book card game Sentinels of the Multiverse explores the heroes, villains, and environments of the Multiverse — those who travel through it, those who have been touched by its vast impossibilities, and...</p>\n\n\n  </article>\n\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n",
